{title: Tremble}
{artist: Andres Figueroa, Hank Bentley, Mariah McManus, Mia Fieldes}
{key: Am}
{tempo: 148}

{comment: Verse 1}
[Am]Peace, bring it all to [F]peace
The storms surrounding [C]me
Let it break, [G]at your name
[Am]Still, call the sea to [F]still
The rage in me to [C]still
Every wave, [G]at your name

{comment: Chorus}
[F]Jesus, Jesus, [Am]you make the [G]darkness tremble
[F]Jesus, Jesus, [Am]you silence [G]fear
[F]Jesus, Jesus, [Am]you make the [G]darkness tremble
[F]Jesus, [Am]Jesus [G]

{comment: Verse 2}
[Am]Breathe, call these bones to [F]leave
Call these lungs to [C]sing
Once again, [Em]I will praise

{comment: Bridge}
Your [F]name is a light that the [C]shadows can’t [G]deny
Your [F]name [G]cannot be [Am]overcome
Your [F]name is alive [C]forever lifted [G]high
Your [F]name [G]cannot be [Am]overcome
